# Emoji, sticker and gif working directories. Deliberately not committed: the
# server deploy is a hard reset of this repo, and there is no reason to ship a
# pile of gifs to the bot host.
#
# emoji_src/emoji_out are tools/emojify.py's in and out trays; sticker_out
# holds 320x320 sticker builds. The gif_* folders are downloaded candidate
# batches to pick from, with *_scores.json the legibility ranking beside them.
emoji_src/
emoji_out/
sticker_out/
gif_candidates/
gif_candidates_2/
gif_angry/
gif_pool/
*_scores.json

